// record of confirmed executions) and rewritten automatically by the
// daily book sync. Do not hand-edit between the BOOK SYNC markers.
//
// Prices come from the Desk feed pipeline first: when BUS_URL and
// BUS_TOKEN are set (Netlify env vars), the function reads the latest
// ticks from the Railway bus GET /snapshot. Any symbol the bus has no
// tick for yet is filled from Yahoo. When those vars are unset, or the
// bus call fails, the whole snapshot falls back to Yahoo Finance v8
// chart, server side, no key. Options are carried at cost (premium
// paid); their live marks come from the levels watch, not this
// endpoint. If every price source fails, the endpoint returns 502 and
// the page falls back to its embedded snapshot. Never serve a fill
// price as a last price.

